  "scope": "The actual original-row minimum controller generates its own index labels and selects the stable positive minimum, then passes that literal selected record index to the same-heap lambda and shifted-row machine. Empty/all-zero input returns the actual absence root. Positive input returns the exact original raw shifted row; no vertices, minimum, index, dimension, width, fuel, lambda or shifted row is supplied. The paid original-input bound and conditional original-bit grid-range bound preserve every input and explicit later loop invariant. Complete guess/solver and outer grid-controller composition remain separate."
}
